{"version":1,"id":"gracie-abrams-i-miss-you-i-m-sorry","title":"I Miss You, I’m Sorry","artist":"Gracie Abrams","key":"G","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/gracie-abrams/i-miss-you-im-sorry/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Sarah Paige Aarons","chords":[{"symbol":"G","canonical":"G","keyboardPitchClasses":[7,11,2],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Em","canonical":"Em","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,7,11],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Bm","canonical":"Bm","keyboardPitchClasses":[11,2,6],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"C","canonical":"C","keyboardPitchClasses":[0,4,7],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"section","text":"[Primeira Parte]","columns":16,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"Do you remember happy together?","columns":31,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Em","column":16,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"I do, don't you","columns":15,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":6,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"Then all of a sudden you're sick to your stomach","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Em","column":21,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"Is that still true?","columns":19,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":8,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"You said \"forever\" in the end I fought it","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Em","column":32,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"Please be honest are we better for it?","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":31,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"Thought you'd hate me but instead you called","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Em","column":35,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"And said \"I miss you\"","columns":21,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"I caught it","columns":11,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"section","text":"[Segunda Parte]","columns":15,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"Good to each other, give it the summer","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Em","column":20,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"I knew, you too","columns":15,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":8,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"But I only saw you once in December","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Em","column":19,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm still confused","columns":18,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":10,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"You said \"forever\" and I almost bought it","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Em","column":32,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"I miss fighting in your old apartment","columns":37,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"Breaking dishes when you're disappointed","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Em","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"I still love you, I promise","columns":27,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":18,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"Nothing happened in the way I wanted","columns":36,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Em","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"Every corner of this house is haunted","columns":37,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":29,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"And I know you said that we're not talking","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Em","column":34,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"But I miss you, I'm sorry","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":16,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"section","text":"[Final]","columns":7,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"I don't wanna go, think I'll make it worse","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Em","column":18,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"Everything I know brings me back to us","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":18,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"I don't wanna go, we've been here before","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Em","column":18,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"Everywhere I go leads me back to you","columns":36,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":18,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"I don't wanna go, think I'll make it worse","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Em","column":18,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"(You said forever and I almost bought it)","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"ly